 <h3><u>Mai zainab hoon</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>(Sham, haye Sham).. (3)<br> (Haye haye Sham) .. (6)<br> (Haye Sham) .. (2), Haye haye sham<br> (Haye Sham).. (2), Haye haye Sham</p> 
  <p>(1) Mere NANA ka kalma padhte ho<br> Insaaf karo aye Sham walo.. (2)<br> Meri maa ZAHRA , Baba hai ALI<br> Wawaila, haye wawaila<br> Aye logo mera NANA hai nabi<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon kuch sharm to karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(2) Main Yasrab ki Shehzadi hoo'n<br> hai bhai mere Sardaar e Jina<br> Main sharm o haya ki makhdooma<br> hai iski gawaahi kaun o makaa<br> hai mere labo'n par gham ki azaa'n<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Chadar jo chini mar jaugi<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp;&nbsp; hoon, kuch sharm toh karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(3) Bhai pe mere kyu baaghi ke<br> ilzaam lagaye hai tumne<br> Saadaat ki aamad se pehle<br> bazaar sajaye hai tumne<br> Gham mere badhaye hai tumne<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Dil thaam ke mai yeh kehti rahi<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon, kuch sharm karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(4) Is tarah MOHAMMAD ke dil ko<br> tum logo ne paamaal kiya<br> Sadqe ki khajuro'n se tumne<br> saadaat ka isteqbaal kiya<br> Sadmo'n ne mera yeh haal kiya<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Tasbeeh meri yeh baat bani<br> Main ZAINAB hoon kuch sharm karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(5) Galiyo me charagha hota hai<br> aur AAL E PAYAMBAR roti hai<br> Naize pe baradar rota hai<br> aur AAL E PAYAMBAR roti hai<br> Is baat pe khwahar roti hai<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Tum hanste rahe mai roti rahi<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon, kuch sharm&nbsp; karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(6) Baalo'n ki safedi par meri<br> meelo'n ki musafat roti hai<br> Na paak nigaahein uthti hai<br> SAJJAD ki ghairat roti hai<br> Is baat pe qismat roti hai<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Be jurm o khata kyu qaidi bani<br> Main ZAINAB hoon, kuch sharm karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(7) Be parda mujhe dekha hi nahi<br> Suraj ne kabhi BABA ki qasam<br> Mehmil ke bina nikli na kabhi<br> hai yaad mujhe woh jaah o hasham<br> Karti hoon buka har ek qadam<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Mehmil ke bina main Sham chali<br> Main ZAINAB hoon,kuch sharm karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(8) Taareekh e sitam dohrayi gayi<br> mujhe jiteji jo maar gayi<br> AMMA ki tarah se ZAINAB bhi<br> peshi ke liye darbaar gayi<br> Aur sar se mere dastaar gayi<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Darbaar talak yeh kehti gayi<br> Main ZAINAB hoon, kuch sharm karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
  <p>(9) Hai kund zabaane aur qalam<br> ashko'n ko zabaa'n kar sakte nahi<br> Irfan aur Mazhar chahe bhi<br> zakhmo'n ko ayaa'n kar sakte nahi<br> Rudaad bayaa'n kar sakte nahi<br> wawaila haye wawaila<br> Kyu kehna pada BIBI ko meri<br> Main ZAINAB hoon, kuch sharm karo</p> 
  <p>(Na cheeno chadar meri,<br> Main ZAINAB&nbsp; hoon ,kuch sharm toh karo).. (2)<br> Na cheeno chadar meri</p> 
